OL,3,GNEWSAScience park redevelopment plans
OL,4,Aapproved
OL,5,
OL,6,FRedevelopment plans that could create
OL,7,F20,000 new jobs and facilities for the
OL,8,Fpublic at Cambridge Science Park have
OL,9,Fbeen approved.
OL,11,FMore than 7,000 people currently work
OL,12,Fat the site - the oldest science park
OL,13,Fin Europe - to develop technologies and
OL,14,Fmedicines.
OL,16,FIts owner, Trinity College, estimates
OL,17,Fthe park will employ between 16,360 and
OL,18,F23,770 people by the end of the
OL,19,Fredevelopment, over the next 25 to 30
OL,20,Fyears.
